# P7: the card logos of the plugin synth engines on the Tracker+ Model list and in the patch editor. The card holds pluck.plg and alco.plg with their
# .plgi logos (plus_flows.sh stages them). Synth 1's Model list steps from WTFM (Synth 1 of the new project a replay starts) down to PLK (row 7, after the 7 built-ins), the list shows the
# PLUCK and ALCO logos, F8 opens the patch editor with the PLUCK editor logo. plus_flows.sh reads the logo slots afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_LOGOS):
# PLK has a list and an editor slot in RAM_G, ALCO a list slot.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus
title: Plugin engine logos on Tracker+ (P7)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

use boot-to-pattern
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
use goto-instrument
wait 1500ms
expect text "Synth 1"
tap Down x4
wait 1500ms
expect text "PLK"
shot logos-list
tap F8
wait 1500ms
expect text "Edit Patch"
shot logos-editor
